  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: db97334eded03654cbd2eef9ce89a40b, type: 3}
  description: Gives every adult citizen an equal vote. The reform broadens political
    legitimacy while challenging institutions built around inherited privilege. Benefits
    include more culture and faster policy-point generation; however, it brings lower
    administrative efficiency.
